      <title>ChatGPT要变&#34;赛博警察&#34;？奥特曼亲口承认：每周1500人求死，AI必须管了！</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/chatgpt1500ai-20250911184004692-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 11 Sep 2025 18:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
